# llm-toolkit-001 repository hygiene (ADR 04 three ownership classes), anchored
# at this root: the kit dogfoods its own loop here. Reviewable kit controls
# (.orch/config.toml, .orch/gate-decisions.json, .orch/gate-remediations.json)
# stay committable; router.md and all other .orch state are the local paper
# trail / private runtime and stay ignored by default. Root-anchored, so the
# tracked config template at template/.orch/config.toml is unaffected.
/.orch/*
!/.orch/config.toml
!/.orch/gate-decisions.json
!/.orch/gate-remediations.json
/router.md
